@101500=~Experimental campaign randomiser: configure items after installation (requires EEex with LuaJIT)~
@101501=~This component requires Enhanced Edition Trilogy (EET).~
@101502=~This component requires EEex. Please install EEex first.~
@101503=~This component cannot be combined with install-time randomisation (Mode 1 or Mode 2).~
@101504=~This component cannot be combined with "More Spell Shield scrolls"; its configurator offers that option for each campaign.~
@101505=~A separately staged campaign runtime (override/M_FLPR.lua) is present. Please remove it before installing this component.~
@101506=~This option is not available with the experimental campaign randomiser; its configurator offers it for each campaign.~
@101507=~This component cannot be combined with the experimental campaign randomiser.~
@101510=~This component requires the EEex LuaJIT component: InfinityLoader.ini must contain exactly one LuaPatchMode line, LuaPatchMode=REPLACE_INTERNAL_WITH_EXTERNAL. Installation stopped.~
@101512=~UI.MENU has no single-player New Game call (startEngine:OnNewGameButtonClick) or character acceptance call (createCharScreen:AcceptCharacter) in a form this component can hook, or it already calls FLPRUI_ functions. Installation stopped.~
@101513=~BALDUR.GAM is missing or is not a GAMEV2.0 new-game template. Installation stopped.~
@101514=~BALDUR.GAM already defines the global FLPR_FRESH more than once or with a value other than 1. Installation stopped.~
@101515=~UI.MENU defines startEngine:OnNewGameButtonClick or createCharScreen:AcceptCharacter itself; this component can only hook calls to them. Installation stopped.~

